nd{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we take the derivatives of $x$ and $y$ with respect to $s,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂s} & =3, \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂s} & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting all of our derivatives into the multivariable chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂s} & =\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\cdot \\frac{∂x}{∂s}+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\cdot \\frac{∂y}{∂s} \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot (3)+(-3)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =(-6)+(3) \\\\  & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529489 1080 "-9" 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529489 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529489 1083 #uuid "9439aba3-1d39-5a23-9a1b-53fd1ddca6be" 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529490 1080 "5" 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529490 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529490 1083 #uuid "9dc9dfd1-c806-54b0-8fb6-09db505bf845" 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529491 1080 "6" 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529491 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529491 1083 #uuid "a4073f67-9581-568f-8d20-40542e4c7699" 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529492 1080 "-3" 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529492 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529492 1083 #uuid "ab4a36cf-8e37-5c93-a940-f0483cf5585c" 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186529483 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186529489 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186529496 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186529498 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186529499 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529493 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139535820 17592186045443 true] [17592186529493 1077 "